  "body": "Perfectly positioned just one street back from Kohimarama Beach, this immaculate apartment offers an unbeatable lock-and-leave lifestyle close to popular waterfront cafés, Madills Farm, and local amenities. \r\n\r\nSeamless indoor-outdoor flow leads directly to your own private garden lawn, creating a serene, pet-friendly sanctuary perfect for weekend entertaining or relaxing after a quick match at the adjacent Kohimarama Tennis and Bowling Clubs.\r\n\r\nFlexibility is at the heart of this residence, currently configured as a spacious single-bedroom layout with the effortless option to adapt into a two-bedroom setup to match your evolving lifestyle needs. Complete with two coveted off-street car parks and easy public transport access, it presents an affordable entry point for first-home buyers, active downsizers, or savvy investors looking for a high-demand address. \r\n\r\nWith motivated vendors ready to move onto their next chapter, this is the ideal window of opportunity to make a competitive move on a prime piece of real estate.\r\n\r\nVisit us at the open homes this weekend or contact John or Antonia to arrange a suitable viewing time during the week.",
